Note on datasets and pretrained weights: per the paper's Data Availability
statement, the training datasets are provided upon request to the authors
as part of ongoing research. This MIT license covers the source code in
this repository; it does not itself grant rights to any third-party
Roboflow datasets ([41], [42]) or pretrained checkpoints referenced in the
paper, which retain their own original licenses.
